#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0361 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: The value of ASTDT is greater than the value of AENDT, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
#note "H2 guard scenario (WORKORDER-H2-guard-coverage / REVIEW1-order-flip.tsv): AENDT - the low operand - is a BLANK cell in a numeric ADaM date column (MissingValue.MIS), and the not empty(AENDT) guard silences the rule despite a populated ASTDT. If this FIRES, the order-flip guard was deleted: post-6c totality positions MIS below every number, so ASTDT > MIS becomes true."
dataset ADLBC
col ASTDT type=Num
col AENDT type=Num
---
21915 | .
